SUMMARY:Homeschool Poetry Teatime with Kenda
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nHave you been wanting to connect with mor
 e spiritually minded homeschoolers?\n\nHomeschool Poetry Teatime is a low 
 key setting for local homeschool families to gather and share our favorite
  poems over tea while making connections with others. Poetry teatime is po
 pular in Charlotte Mason style schooling\, and we will enjoy it without th
 e pressure of religion\, instead focusing on making friends in a setting t
 hat is welcoming to folks who are more spiritual/ energetic in their perso
 nal practices.\n\nEnergetic Experiences has an excellent Reference Library
  of spiritual books\, tarot and oracle cards that you can consult while th
 ere. Also check out the free book shelf too!\n\nWhat do you need for poetr
 y teatime?\nPlease bring a poem or two to share\, and your favorite tea cu
 p if you want\, or use one of ours. Tea will be provided.\n\nLocal homesch
 oolers of all ages are welcome\, we just ask that everyone be respectful o
 f the space\, the library\, and the crystals. Feel free to drop in or stay
  for the whole two hours.\n\nCapacity: 40 people\nPrice: $3 per person\, c
 ash\, PayPal\, zelle\, cashapp
