SUMMARY:The Crystal Portal Experience 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nTo purchase a ticket\, go to: [https://ww
 w.crystalportalexperience.com/events](https://www.crystalportalexperience.
 com/events)\n\nStep into Moldavite Life's Crystal Portal **with over 100\,
 000 crystals\, minerals\, tektites\, and meteorites**.\n\n**The Crystal Po
 rtal Experience** will begin with an introduction from Levi about The Crys
 tal Portal.\n\nHe will guide you through **a relaxing sound bath and medit
 ation** to prepare you to walk through The Crystal Portal.\n\nYou will hav
 e time to **walk through The Crystal Portal** on your own.\n\nThere will b
 e time for **integration and discussion** at the end.\n\nOur space is smal
 l and cozy\, creating an intimate setting for this powerful experience. **
 Chairs will be available for seating.**\n\nCome and immerse yourself in th
 e frequencies of the crystals.\n\nThe Crystal Portal is a **functional wor
 k of art** and also the **masterpiece of Levi Reynolds**\, an innovator an
 d modern-day alchemist who spent more than three years channeling its crea
 tion.\n\nBorn from **over 100 hours of deep meditation** with his spirit g
 uides\, all the **crystals work together synergistically** to operate on b
 oth quantum and multidimensional levels.\n\nThese minerals **activate the 
 light body**\, offering the opportunity to collectively raise and transfor
 m consciousness.\n\nInfused with **sacred geometry\, elemental balance\, a
 nd quantum energy alchemy**\, the Crystal Portal is centered within a **9-
 foot** diameter high-vibration crystal grid that grounds the **vortex ener
 gy** to the Earth\\*\\*.\\*\\*\n\nThere are **over 8\,000 beads**\, about 
 a third of them handmade.\n\nThere are many **Synergy 12 stones**\, includ
 ing **over 15 lbs. of tektites and meteorites\,** including **Moldavite\, 
 Libyan Desert Glass\,** and many **rare meteorites.**\n\nThere are **over 
 400 Phenakite crystals** from around the world!\n\nThe Crystal Portal feat
 ures **fossilized lightning**\, also known as fulgurite.\n\nThere are repr
 esentations of **all elements**: earth\, water\, fire\, stone\, wood\, air
 \, and ether.\n\nTowering **selenite** beams channel clarity and purity\, 
 acting as luminous conduits of light that cleanse and elevate the entire e
 nergetic field of the Portal.\n\nHundreds of **Herkimer Diamonds** amplify
  the Portal’s frequency\, their exceptional clarity magnifying intention
  and unlocking higher states of awareness.\n\nTo deepen the experience\, L
 evi increases the resonance of the Crystal Portal with **gongs and sound b
 owls upgraded with crystals\, minerals\, tektites\, and meteorites**\, alo
 ng with **angel chimes**\, creating a transformative soundscape.\n\nWalkin
 g through the Crystal Portal is an invitation to align with its resonance\
 ; **participation is optional**. Admission includes access to the venue re
 gardless of whether you choose to enter the Crystal Portal itself.\n\nPart
 icipants will have 1 hour after the experience to shop in the Moldavite Li
 fe Crystal Shop.\n\n✨ For deeper insight into its creation\, check out [
 The Crystal Portal Podcast](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCy-XLVX5gvp-O
 0emNmp4E2g).\n\nAll participants are required to agree to the [Participant
  Requirements & The Crystal Portal Waiver](https://drive.google.com/file/d
 /1541Yz5UGX-2mnofnb76UZR19kay3-woW/view?usp=drive_link) when purchasing ti
 ckets. **Make sure you click "Select a Time" to pick the date and time you
  want to attend.**\n\nTo purchase a ticket\, go to: https://www.crystalpor
 talexperience.com/events
